### Peticiones de prueba para SmartLibrary (VS Code REST Client o IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@api = http://localhost:8080/api/prestamos

### 1. Prestamo de libro disponible -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estudianteId": "est-1", "libroId": "lib-1" }

### 2. Libro ya prestado -> 409 Conflict
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estudianteId": "est-2", "libroId": "lib-1" }

### 3. Estudiante inexistente -> 404 Not Found
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estudianteId": "est-99", "libroId": "lib-2" }

### 4. Libro inexistente -> 404 Not Found
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estudianteId": "est-1", "libroId": "lib-99" }

### 5. Consulta de prestamos -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}

### Extra. Solicitud sin libroId -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "estudianteId": "est-1" }
